  "task_html": "<div style='background:#fff7f4;border:1.5px solid #fcd9c8;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;margin:10px 0;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 6px;color:#d95f2b;'>Was sind die drei Gesichter?</p><p style='font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 10px;'>Dieselbe Situation lässt sich auf drei Arten darstellen. Den Wechsel zwischen den Darstellungen nennt man <strong>Darstellungswechsel</strong>.</p><div style='display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:stretch;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:8px;'><div style='background:#eff6ff;border:1.5px solid #2563eb;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px;flex:1;min-width:70px;'><div style='font-size:10px;color:#2563eb;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px;letter-spacing:.5px;'>&#9312; GLEICHUNG</div><div style='font-size:12px;font-family:monospace;font-weight:600;'>y = mx + b</div></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 4px;font-size:16px;color:#9ca3af;'>&#8644;</div><div style='background:#f0fdf4;border:1.5px solid #16a34a;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px;flex:1;min-width:70px;'><div style='font-size:10px;color:#16a34a;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px;letter-spacing:.5px;'>&#9313; WERTETABELLE</div><div style='font-size:11px;font-family:monospace;line-height:1.5;'>x | 0 | 1 | 2<br>y | b | &hellip; | &hellip;</div></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 4px;font-size:16px;color:#9ca3af;'>&#8644;</div><div style='background:#fef3c7;border:1.5px solid #d97706;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px;flex:1;min-width:70px;'><div style='font-size:10px;color:#d97706;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px;letter-spacing:.5px;'>&#9314; GRAPH</div><div style='font-size:12px;'>Gerade im Koordinatensystem</div></div></div><p style='font-size:12px;color:#6b7280;margin:0;'>Alle drei zeigen <em>dieselbe</em> Information &ndash; nur in verschiedener Form.</p></div><div style='background:#eff6ff;border:1.5px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;margin:10px 0;'><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;'>Ein Elektrizit&auml;tsunternehmen bietet den Tarif <strong>AKZENT</strong> an: <strong>6&euro;</strong> monatlicher Grundpreis + <strong>0,32&euro;</strong> je kWh.</p><p style='font-size:13px;margin:6px 0 0;'>Gleichung: <span style='font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;'>y = 0,32x + 6</span></p></div><p style='font-size:14px;margin:12px 0 4px;'><strong>Aufgabe A</strong> &ndash; Gleichung &rarr; Wertetabelle</p><p style='font-size:13px;color:#4b5563;margin:0 0 8px;'>Berechne die monatlichen Kosten y f&uuml;r die angegebenen Verbr&auml;uche x.</p><div class='tbl-wrap'><table><thead><tr><th style='background:#2563eb;'>x (kWh)</th><th style='background:#2563eb;'>0</th><th style='background:#2563eb;'>10</th><th style='background:#2563eb;'>20</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class='row-label'>y (&euro;)</td><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='6' placeholder='?'></td><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='9.2' placeholder='?'></td><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='12.4' placeholder='?'></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style='font-size:14px;margin:14px 0 4px;'><strong>Aufgabe B</strong> &ndash; Graph ablesen (Wertetabelle &#8644; Graph)</p><p style='font-size:13px;color:#4b5563;margin:0 0 4px;'>Der Graph zeigt den Tarif AKZENT als Gerade. Der orange Punkt liegt bei x&nbsp;=&nbsp;25&nbsp;kWh &ndash; lies den zugeh&ouml;rigen y-Wert ab.</p><svg viewBox='0 0 265 185' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' style='width:100%;max-width:280px;display:block;margin:10px auto;'><defs><marker id='ax2' markerWidth='5' markerHeight='5' refX='5' refY='2.5' orient='auto'><polygon points='0,0 5,2.5 0,5' fill='#374151'/></marker><marker id='ay2' markerWidth='5' markerHeight='5' refX='2.5' refY='0' orient='auto'><polygon points='0,5 2.5,0 5,5' fill='#374151'/></marker></defs><line x1='109' y1='12' x2='109' y2='162' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='175' y1='12' x2='175' y2='162' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='242' y1='12' x2='242' y2='162' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='42' y1='125' x2='242' y2='125' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='42' y1='87' x2='242' y2='87' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='42' y1='50' x2='242' y2='50' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='42' y1='12' x2='242' y2='12' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='42' y1='162' x2='250' y2='162' stroke='#374151' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#ax2)'/><line x1='42' y1='162' x2='42' y2='6' stroke='#374151' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#ay2)'/><line x1='109' y1='161' x2='109' y2='165' stroke='#374151' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='175' y1='161' x2='175' y2='165' stroke='#374151' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='242' y1='161' x2='242' y2='165' stroke='#374151' stroke-width='1'/><text x='109' y='174' font-size='9' fill='#6b7280' text-anchor='middle'>10</text><text x='175' y='174' font-size='9' fill='#6b7280' text-anchor='middle'>20</text><text x='242' y='174' font-size='9' fill='#6b7280' text-anchor='middle'>30</text><text x='152' y='183' font-size='8' fill='#9ca3af' text-anchor='middle'>x (kWh)</text><line x1='38' y1='125' x2='42' y2='125' stroke='#374151' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='38' y1='87' x2='42' y2='87' stroke='#374151' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='38' y1='50' x2='42' y2='50' stroke='#374151' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='38' y1='12' x2='42' y2='12' stroke='#374151' stroke-width='1'/><text x='35' y='128' font-size='9' fill='#6b7280' text-anchor='end'>4</text><text x='35' y='90' font-size='9' fill='#6b7280' text-anchor='end'>8</text><text x='35' y='53' font-size='9' fill='#6b7280' text-anchor='end'>12</text><text x='35' y='15' font-size='9' fill='#6b7280' text-anchor='end'>16</text><text x='20' y='90' font-size='8' fill='#9ca3af' text-anchor='middle' transform='rotate(-90,20,90)'>y (&euro;)</text><line x1='42' y1='106' x2='242' y2='16' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.5'/><text x='125' y='52' font-size='8' fill='#2563eb' transform='rotate(-24,125,52)'>y = 0,32x + 6</text><line x1='209' y1='162' x2='209' y2='31' stroke='#d95f2b' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-dasharray='4,3'/><line x1='42' y1='31' x2='209' y2='31' stroke='#d95f2b' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-dasharray='4,3'/><circle cx='209' cy='31' r='4.5' fill='#d95f2b' stroke='white' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='209' y='174' font-size='9' fill='#d95f2b' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>25</text><text x='29' y='34' font-size='9' fill='#d95f2b' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>?</text></svg><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:4px;'><input class='cell-input' data-ans='14' placeholder='? &euro;' style='max-width:100px;'><span style='font-size:13px;color:#6b7280;'>&euro;</span></div><div class='check-bar'><button class='btn-check' onclick='checkStation(2)'>&#x2713; &Uuml;berpr&uuml;fen</button><button class='btn-reset' onclick='resetStation(2)'>&#x21BA; Zur&uuml;cksetzen</button><span class='check-result' id='check-result-2'></span></div>",
  "sol_html": "<p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.9;'><strong>Aufgabe A &ndash; Wertetabelle:</strong><br>y(0) = 0,32&middot;0 + 6 = <strong>6 &euro;</strong><br>y(10) = 0,32&middot;10 + 6 = 3,2 + 6 = <strong>9,20 &euro;</strong><br>y(20) = 0,32&middot;20 + 6 = 6,4 + 6 = <strong>12,40 &euro;</strong><br><br><strong>Aufgabe B &ndash; Graph ablesen:</strong><br>Bei x = 25 kWh zeigt der Graph y = <strong>14 &euro;</strong>.<br>Probe: 0,32 &middot; 25 + 6 = 8 + 6 = 14 &#10003;<br><br><strong>Die drei Gesichter im &Uuml;berblick:</strong><br>&#9312; Gleichung: y = 0,32x + 6<br>&#9313; Wertetabelle: (0|6), (10|9,2), (20|12,4), (25|14), &hellip;<br>&#9314; Graph: Gerade mit Steigung 0,32 und y-Achsenabschnitt 6</p>",
  "mandatory": true
}
